Photographs, screenshots, videos, hardware design files, and other non-software
material are not covered by the MIT grant above unless separately identified
as such. Their inclusion does not transfer rights in depicted third-party
material. No trademark rights or endorsement are granted by this notice.
5. Scope and disclaimers
-----------------------
Copyright remains with the respective rights holders. Each applicable
license's conditions and warranty/liability provisions govern its material.
This notice grants no rights that the dESPcent authors do not hold, and does
not relicense another contributor's material without their authorization.
When redistributing, include this notice and the applicable license texts and
